        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Products: \"Save Me\"\n- Organizations: Silver Convention\n- Topics: Euro disco, Eurodisco\n- Places: Germany\n\nFacts:\n- In the later 1970s, Euro disco, or Eurodisco, evolved in Europe from disco.\n- Euro disco is a variety of European electronic dance music.\n- Euro disco incorporates elements of pop, new wave, and rock into a disco-like continuous dance atmosphere.\n- Silver Convention is a German Euro disco group.\n- \"Save Me\" is a song by Silver Convention.\n- \"Save Me\" became a hit in Germany.",
